{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>LOST ALTR</i> is a casual solo card game set within the crumbling halls of a forgotten temple. You\u2019ll face a series of Trials\u2014mysterious encounters drawn from an ever-shifting deck. Each completed Trial leads you deeper into the Ruins of ALTR. Use Aspect cards to shape your fate\u2014mysterious forces that grant you powerful advantages, but always at a cost.    </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built on the foundation of the Scoundrel card mechanics by Zach Gage and Kurt Biegand, a heavily reimagined experience, <i>LOST ALTR\u00a0</i>blends strategy, luck, and lore in a dark, esoteric world. The path forward is never the same. The further you go, the more the ruins remember.<br><br><strong>What's Included</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hierophant Journey (Standard Rules and Aspect Cards)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 Aspect Cards to Collect through various Floors (Available in Journey Only)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neophyte (Single Trial with reduced cards and no Aspect Cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adeptus (Single Trial with Standard Rules and no Aspect Cards) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early Access will evolve with new cards, mechanics, and layers of mystery\u2014shaped by feedback from those brave enough to enter the ALTR.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Neophyte","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612900/27783f1a5aa3eabf9b2ca77a6df29930af088ad7.jpg"},{"name":"Adeptus","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612900/1368b62dce65ad787a63be6be65d7227042cd454.jpg"},{"name":"Hierophant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3612900/deec2ae5aecf50ad6c1e183e6145c53a9f52f4a3.jpg"},{"name":"Lost","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommuni